Package: vexpad
Version: 2.2.1-1
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Nour-yahyaoui <https://github.com/Nour-yahyaoui>
Depends: vim-tiny | vim | nvi
Description: VexOS terminal text editor
 vexpad is a small terminal editor with a built-in cheat sheet
 (vexpad --help). It runs vi underneath.
